# Dances with Luopans (adoulin 118), the offer's other options: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin. Sylvie: 31,
# finished on 2: declined (Declined 1); 32 on 2: nothing; Declined 0 (a GM): 31 on 1: begun. Prog 0, no Luopan: 33.
lists WesternAdoulin/Sylvie/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/31
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=79.594,32,135.725 job=WAR lvl=99
login
trigger Sylvie                          # available: 31
finish option=2                         # not option 1: declined: Declined 1
trigger Sylvie                          # Declined 1: 32
finish option=2                         # not option 1: nothing
charvar Quest[9][118]Declined 0          # a GM
trigger Sylvie                          # available, Declined 0: 31
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Sylvie                          # Prog 0, no Luopan: 33
finish
